    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.poster.avif?t=1636396039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.webm?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.mp4?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In Self Made Man, you play as an entrepreneur who starts from nothing and wants to become the richest man in the world. Discover the land of Rocket Island and its many opportunities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/18e4a602476ead2c56d08b1288e908dc.poster.avif?t=1636396039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/18e4a602476ead2c56d08b1288e908dc.webm?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/18e4a602476ead2c56d08b1288e908dc.mp4?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the land of Rocket Island through its open and immersive world  <br></li><li>Your activities evolve as your company evolves: Deliver orders, hire employees, buy a warehouse and many more! <br></li><li>Face unexpected and crazy events but be careful not to lose everything by making a wrong decision.  <br></li><li>Make your own progression choices and discover dozens of side activities: kayak, fishing, and more! <br></li><li>Explore our vibrant open world and its secrets! </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get your first dollars</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/ac12b04b3a691db98a39b64ee03d08e1.poster.avif?t=1636396039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/ac12b04b3a691db98a39b64ee03d08e1.webm?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/ac12b04b3a691db98a39b64ee03d08e1.mp4?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You left everything behind and just arrived on Rocket Island, you will have to do odd jobs to get your first dollars: <strong>Food delivery, garbage collection, pet sitting, help the farmers, cashier, hotel cleaner, safety officer</strong> and more! <br><br>If you\u2019re lazy you could also find others ways to make money but be careful, police are never far away !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Start making business</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/74fa915a9f965d6d9e0516c30d53ae7d.poster.avif?t=1636396039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/74fa915a9f965d6d9e0516c30d53ae7d.webm?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/74fa915a9f965d6d9e0516c30d53ae7d.mp4?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Now you have enough money to buy your first room, to make it profitable you will have to be resourceful: <strong>Use your metal detector, fish with magnet</strong> in the lakes and <strong>find old objects to restore</strong> that you can resell!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Open your first shop</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/66c67e31476ce866560da7153ae7653f.poster.avif?t=1636396039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/66c67e31476ce866560da7153ae7653f.webm?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/66c67e31476ce866560da7153ae7653f.mp4?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A location is for sale in the shopping center, it's an opportunity for you to <strong>open your own store</strong>. <strong>Repaint the walls, choose the products you want to sell, make sales with your customers</strong> and <strong>negotiate the prices</strong>. Will you be a good enough salesman to attract customers to your store? <br><br>Be careful with your supplies, logistical problems could sink your business!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scale your business</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/22e074177f05ecbb1d416811a3dde9bf.avif?t=1636396039\" /></div><br>Your business is now doing well, you will have to <strong>hire your first employees</strong> to help you in your daily tasks and launch new activities: <strong>new stores, real estate investment, purchase of company shares, become a business angel</strong> and much more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become the biggest company</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/d5128be8bc56a3a2199b079532413915.avif?t=1636396039\" /></div><br>You are now the head of a financial empire, every strategic decision will have a significant impact on your company. Make the right decisions, find levers to make your company grow even more: <strong>lobbying, politics, mafia</strong>, and more!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.poster.avif?t=1636396039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.webm?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.mp4?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In Self Made Man, you play as an entrepreneur who starts from nothing and wants to become the richest man in the world. Discover the land of Rocket Island and its many opportunities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/18e4a602476ead2c56d08b1288e908dc.poster.avif?t=1636396039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/18e4a602476ead2c56d08b1288e908dc.webm?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697550/extras/18e4a602476ead2c56d08b1288e908dc.mp4?t=1636396039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the land of Rocket Island through its open and immersive world  <br></li><li>Your activities evolve as your company evolves: Deliver orders, hire employees, buy a warehouse and many more! <br></li><li>Face unexpected and crazy events but be careful not to lose everything by making a wrong decision.  <br></li><li>Make your own progression choices and discover dozens of side activities: kayak, fishing, and more! <br></li><li>Explore our vibrant open world and its secrets! </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><s